WEBVTT

00:03:56.294 --> 00:04:01.057
And I realized that they were
performing for God,

00:04:01.081 --> 00:04:03.768
whatever that means.

00:04:03.792 --> 00:04:07.356
But somehow, it didn't
matter about the publicity.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.607
There was no money involved.

00:04:09.631 --> 00:04:12.827
It wasn't going to be written down.
It was no news.

00:04:12.851 --> 00:04:14.973
And there were these incredible artists

00:04:14.997 --> 00:04:18.474
that felt for me like an eternity
as they performed.

00:04:18.498 --> 00:04:20.559
The next moment,

00:04:20.583 --> 00:04:24.619
as soon as they finished
and disappeared into the shadows,

00:04:24.643 --> 00:04:27.125
a young man with a propane
lantern came on,

00:04:27.149 --> 00:04:29.376
hung it up on a tree, set up a curtain.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:32.837
The village square was filled
with hundreds of people.